practiceProblems.problemStatement:
Chain functional operations together from scratch:

1. Functional Interface Transformer:
   - Method: String transform(String s);
   - Default Method: default Transformer andThen(Transformer next):
     return (s) -> next.transform(this.transform(s));

2. Implementing Classes:
   - Class UpperCaseTransformer: @Override transform(s) returning s.toUpperCase()
   - Class TagTransformer: @Override transform(s) returning '<' + s + '>'

Test in Main:
Transformer upper = new UpperCaseTransformer();
Transformer tag = new TagTransformer();
Transformer pipeline = upper.andThen(tag);
Print pipeline.transform("learn java oop");.

practiceProblems.solutionCode:
@FunctionalInterface
interface Transformer {
    String transform(String s);
    default Transformer andThen(Transformer next) {
        return (s) -> next.transform(this.transform(s));
    }
}

public class TransformerPipelineApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Transformer trim = (s) -> s.trim();
        Transformer upper = (s) -> s.toUpperCase();
        Transformer wrap = (s) -> "<" + s + ">";

        Transformer pipeline = trim.andThen(upper).andThen(wrap);
        System.out.println(pipeline.transform("   learn java oop   "));
    }
}
